A desirable property of a ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/lambda-calculus.td")} where every term all evaluates to a ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/normal-form.td")}, whether they become ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/stuck-term.td")} or Value. This property may not hold in most systems.
